      "title": "snapshot.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <style>\n    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; color: #334155; }\n    .slide-container { \n      width: 1280px; \n      min-height: 720px; \n      background: #F8F6F2; \n      display: flex; \n      flex-direction: column;\n      padding: 48px;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    \n    .motif-line {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 80px;\n      left: 48px;\n      right: 48px;\n      height: 1px;\n      background: #0F172A;\n    }\n    \n    .tracker-label {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 54px;\n      right: 48px;\n      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      color: #334155;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n    }\n    \n    .content-area {\n      flex: 1;\n      padding-top: 80px; /* Space below motif line */\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      justify-content: flex-end;\n    }\n    \n    .title-block {\n      max-width: 800px;\n      margin-bottom: 80px;\n    }\n    \n    h1 {\n      font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;\n      font-size: 56px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: #0F172A;\n      line-height: 1.1;\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\n    }\n    \n    .metadata-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n      gap: 40px;\n      border-top: 1px solid #CBD5E1;\n      padding-top: 32px;\n      width: 100%;\n    }\n    \n    .meta-item label {\n      display: block;\n      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n      color: #334155;\n    }\n    \n    .meta-item .value {\n      font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;\n      font-size: 24px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #0F172A;\n    }\n    \n    .status-tag {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      color: #D97706; /* status-prog */\n    }\n    \n    .dot {\n      width: 12px;\n      height: 12px;\n      background: currentColor;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"slide-container\">\n    <div class=\"tracker-label\">SYS_INV // STATUS // 2026-10-15</div>\n    <div class=\"motif-line\"></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"content-area\">\n      <div class=\"title-block\">\n        <h1>Project Tracker:<br>Inventory & Sales System</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 600px;\">\n          Deployment in progress. Core builds are successful; production database initialization and final validation remain unresolved.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"metadata-grid\">\n        <div class=\"meta-item\">\n          <label>Overall Status</label>\n          <div class=\"value status-tag\">\n            <span class=\"dot\"></span>\n            IN PROGRESS\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"meta-item\">\n          <label>Last Log Received</label>\n          <div class=\"value\">2026-10-15</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"meta-item\">\n          <label>Critical Blocker</label>\n          <div class=\"value\" style=\"color: #E16D5E;\">DATABASE_URL / SCHEMA</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
