      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "architecture.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; color: #334155; }\n    .slide-container { \n      width: 1280px; \n      min-height: 720px; \n      background: #F8F6F2; \n      display: flex; \n      flex-direction: column;\n      padding: 48px;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    \n    .motif-line {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 80px;\n      left: 48px;\n      right: 48px;\n      height: 1px;\n      background: #0F172A;\n    }\n    \n    .tracker-label {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 54px;\n      right: 48px;\n      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      color: #334155;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n    }\n    \n    .content-area {\n      flex: 1;\n      padding-top: 80px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    \n    h2 {\n      font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;\n      font-size: 32px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: #0F172A;\n      margin-top: 40px;\n      margin-bottom: 60px;\n    }\n\n    .arch-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n      gap: 0;\n      align-items: center;\n      flex: 1;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n\n    .node {\n      border: 1px solid #0F172A;\n      padding: 24px;\n      text-align: left;\n      height: 180px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      background: transparent;\n      z-index: 10;\n    }\n\n    .node label {\n      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      color: #334155;\n    }\n\n    .node .name {\n      font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;\n      font-size: 20px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #0F172A;\n    }\n\n    .connector {\n      height: 1px;\n      background: #0F172A;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n\n    .connector::after {\n      content: '';\n      position: absolute;\n      right: 0;\n      top: -4px;\n      width: 0;\n      height: 0;\n      border-top: 4px solid transparent;\n      border-bottom: 4px solid transparent;\n      border-left: 8px solid #0F172A;\n    }\n\n    .boundary-label {\n      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      background: #F8F6F2;\n      padding: 0 8px;\n      position: absolute;\n      top: -14px;\n      left: 50%;\n      transform: translateX(-50%);\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"slide-container\">\n    <div class=\"tracker-label\">SYS_INV // ARCHITECTURE</div>\n    <div class=\"motif-line\"></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"content-area\">\n      <h2>How the system fits together</h2>\n      \n      <div class=\"arch-grid\">\n        <!-- Client -->\n        <div class=\"node\">\n          <label>Edge / Client</label>\n          <div class=\"name\">Web Browser</div>\n          <p class=\"text-[12px]\">Token-based auth<br>LocalStorage</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Connection 1 -->\n        <div class=\"connector mx-4\">\n          <span class=\"boundary-label\">HTTPS / JSON</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Frontend -->\n        <div class=\"node\">\n          <label>UI Tier (Vercel)</label>\n          <div class=\"name\">Next.js App</div>\n          <p class=\"text-[12px]\">React 19 / Tailwind 4<br>Axios Interceptors</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col h-full justify-center\">\n            <div class=\"connector ml-4 mr-0\">\n                <span class=\"boundary-label\">REST API (JWT)</span>\n            </div>\n            <!-- API -->\n            <div class=\"node mt-12 ml-4\">\n                <label>Logic Tier (Render)</label>\n                <div class=\"name\">Express API</div>\n                <p class=\"text-[12px]\">TypeScript / Zod<br>CORS Filtering</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col h-full justify-center\">\n             <div class=\"connector ml-0 mr-4\">\n                <span class=\"boundary-label\">PG Pool / SQL</span>\n            </div>\n            <!-- DB -->\n            <div class=\"node mt-12 mr-4\">\n                <label>Data Tier (Render)</label>\n                <div class=\"name\">PostgreSQL</div>\n                <p class=\"text-[12px]\">Raw SQL / Migrations<br>UUID Primary Keys</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"mt-auto pt-12 border-t border-[#CBD5E1]\">\n        <p class=\"text-[13px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500\">Security Boundary:</p>\n        <p class=\"text-[15px] mt-2\">All protected data is user-scoped. The API acts as the authoritative gate, validating JWT identity and enforcing isolation across all database operations.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    },
