      "title": "progress.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; color: #334155; }\n    .slide-container { \n      width: 1280px; \n      min-height: 720px; \n      background: #F8F6F2; \n      display: flex; \n      flex-direction: column;\n      padding: 48px;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    \n    .motif-line {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 80px;\n      left: 48px;\n      right: 48px;\n      height: 1px;\n      background: #0F172A;\n    }\n    \n    .tracker-label {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 54px;\n      right: 48px;\n      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      color: #334155;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n    }\n    \n    .content-area {\n      flex: 1;\n      padding-top: 80px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    \n    h2 {\n      font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;\n      font-size: 32px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: #0F172A;\n      margin-top: 40px;\n      margin-bottom: 48px;\n    }\n\n    .check-list {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      gap: 60px;\n    }\n\n    .item {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 24px;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      margin-bottom: 40px;\n    }\n\n    .marker {\n      width: 24px;\n      height: 24px;\n      border: 1px solid #0F172A;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n      margin-top: 4px;\n    }\n\n    .marker.done {\n      background: #0D9488;\n      border-color: #0D9488;\n    }\n\n    .marker.prog {\n      background: transparent;\n      border-style: dashed;\n    }\n\n    .marker.done::after {\n      content: '✓';\n      color: white;\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .item-content h3 {\n      font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;\n      font-size: 20px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #0F172A;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .item-content p {\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n\n    .status-note {\n      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      margin-top: 8px;\n      display: block;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"slide-container\">\n    <div class=\"tracker-label\">SYS_INV // PROGRESS</div>\n    <div class=\"motif-line\"></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"content-area\">\n      <h2>Progress: what is verified</h2>\n      \n      <div class=\"check-list\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"item\">\n            <div class=\"marker done\"></div>\n            <div class=\"item-content\">\n              <h3>System Documentation</h3>\n              <p>Full architecture, data flow, and security documentation completed.</p>\n              <span class=\"status-note text-[#0D9488]\">ARTIFACTS READY</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"item\">\n            <div class=\"marker done\"></div>\n            <div class=\"item-content\">\n              <h3>API Reference</h3>\n              <p>All endpoints, auth rules, and request/response shapes documented.</p>\n              <span class=\"status-note text-[#0D9488]\">CONTRACT DEFINED</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"item\">\n            <div class=\"marker done\"></div>\n            <div class=\"item-content\">\n              <h3>Backend Build</h3>\n              <p>Render production build successfully completed with dev dependencies.</p>\n              <span class=\"status-note text-[#0D9488]\">CI/CD VERIFIED</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"item\">\n            <div class=\"marker prog\"></div>\n            <div class=\"item-content\">\n              <h3>Frontend Fix (Local)</h3>\n              <p>Resolved \"currentUser\" TypeScript error. Needs push and Vercel redeploy.</p>\n              <span class=\"status-note text-[#D97706]\">STAGED LOCALLY</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"item\">\n            <div class=\"marker prog\"></div>\n            <div class=\"item-content\">\n              <h3>Deployment Config</h3>\n              <p>Environment keys verified. Trailing slash issue in FRONTEND_URL identified.</p>\n              <span class=\"status-note text-[#D97706]\">AWAITING UPDATE</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    },
