      "path": "blockers.html",
      "mimeType": "text/html",
      "title": "blockers.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; color: #334155; }\n    .slide-container { \n      width: 1280px; \n      height: 720px;\n      background: #F8F6F2; \n      display: flex; \n      flex-direction: column;\n      padding: 32px;\n      position: relative;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    \n    .motif-line {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 48px;\n      left: 32px;\n      right: 32px;\n      height: 1px;\n      background: #0F172A;\n      opacity: 0.12;\n    }\n    \n    .tracker-label {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 20px;\n      right: 32px;\n      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      color: #334155;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n    }\n    \n    .content-area {\n      flex: 1;\n      padding-top: 56px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    \n    h2 {\n      font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;\n      font-size: 28px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: #0F172A;\n      margin: 4px 0 18px 0;\n    }\n\n    table {\n      width: 100%;\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      margin-bottom: 18px;\n    }\n\n    th {\n      text-align: left;\n      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      padding: 10px 18px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #0F172A;\n      color: #334155;\n    }\n\n    td {\n      padding: 14px 18px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #CBD5E1;\n      vertical-align: top;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      line-height: 1.3;\n    }\n\n    .risk-tag {\n      font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #E16D5E; /* status-risk */\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .diamond {\n      width: 8px;\n      height: 8px;\n      background: #E16D5E;\n      transform: rotate(45deg);\n      display: inline-block;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    .impact-high {\n      color: #E16D5E;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    .note-box {\n      margin-top: auto;\n      padding: 12px;\n      border: 1px solid #E16D5E;\n      background: #FDF1F0;\n    }\n\n    .note-title {\n      color: #E16D5E;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\n    }\n\n    code {\n      background: #F1EFEC;\n      padding: 2px 6px;\n      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"slide-container\">\n    <div class=\"tracker-label\">SYS_INV // BLOCKERS</div>\n    <div class=\"motif-line\"></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"content-area\">\n      <h2>Critical blockers & risks</h2>\n      \n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th width=\"30%\">Risk / Blocker</th>\n            <th width=\"40%\">Impact</th>\n            <th width=\"30%\">Mitigation Required</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td>\n              <div class=\"risk-tag\"><span class=\"diamond\"></span>SCHEMA MISSING</div>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\">Registration fails with <code>\"users\" does not exist</code>. Connection resets prevent local migration.</td>\n            <td class=\"impact-high text-[14px]\">Confirm startup migrations in Render or resolve port 5432 reset.</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>\n              <div class=\"risk-tag\"><span class=\"diamond\"></span>EXPOSED SECRETS</div>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\">PostgreSQL credentials and JWT secret were visible in previous screenshots.</td>\n            <td class=\"impact-high text-[14px]\">Rotate DB password immediately and update Render environment.</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>\n              <div class=\"risk-tag\"><span class=\"diamond\"></span>CORS MISCONFIG</div>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"text-[15px] leading-snug\">Trailing slash in <code>FRONTEND_URL</code> prevents browser requests from the live site.</td>\n            <td class=\"text-[14px]\">Verify exact origin string in Render Environment panel.</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n\n      <div class=\"note-box\">\n        <p class=\"note-title\">Technical Warning:</p>\n        <p class=\"text-[15px]\">Until the database schema is initialized, the system is functionally offline. All frontend fixes are secondary to ensuring the backend can persist user records.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
    },
