      "title": "next_steps.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; color: #334155; }\n    .slide-container { \n      width: 1280px; \n      min-height: 720px; \n      background: #F8F6F2; \n      display: flex; \n      flex-direction: column;\n      padding: 48px;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n    \n    .motif-line {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 80px;\n      left: 48px;\n      right: 48px;\n      height: 1px;\n      background: #0F172A;\n    }\n    \n    .tracker-label {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 54px;\n      right: 48px;\n      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      color: #334155;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n    }\n    \n    .content-area {\n      flex: 1;\n      padding-top: 80px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    \n    h2 {\n      font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;\n      font-size: 32px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: #0F172A;\n      margin-top: 40px;\n      margin-bottom: 80px;\n    }\n\n    .timeline {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      position: relative;\n      margin-top: 40px;\n    }\n\n    .timeline::before {\n      content: '';\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 40px;\n      left: 0;\n      right: 0;\n      height: 1px;\n      background: #CBD5E1;\n      z-index: 1;\n    }\n\n    .step {\n      width: 18%;\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 2;\n    }\n\n    .dot {\n      width: 80px;\n      height: 80px;\n      background: #F8F6F2;\n      border: 1px solid #0F172A;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      margin-bottom: 32px;\n      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n      font-size: 24px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #0F172A;\n    }\n\n    .step.active .dot {\n      background: #0F172A;\n      color: white;\n    }\n\n    .step h3 {\n      font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #0F172A;\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n      line-height: 1.3;\n    }\n\n    .step p {\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"slide-container\">\n    <div class=\"tracker-label\">SYS_INV // ROADMAP</div>\n    <div class=\"motif-line\"></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"content-area\">\n      <h2>Next steps to production</h2>\n      \n      <div class=\"timeline\">\n        <div class=\"step active\">\n          <div class=\"dot\">01</div>\n          <h3>Rotate & Configure</h3>\n          <p>Update Render with new DB credentials and fresh JWT_SECRET.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"dot\">02</div>\n          <h3>Run Migrations</h3>\n          <p>Verify schema creation in logs or via local external connection.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"dot\">03</div>\n          <h3>Deploy Frontend</h3>\n          <p>Push local \"currentUser\" fix and confirm successful Vercel build.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"dot\">04</div>\n          <h3>Origin Check</h3>\n          <p>Confirm FRONTEND_URL in Render has no trailing slash.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"dot\">05</div>\n          <h3>Smoke Test</h3>\n          <p>End-to-end test of registration, login, and product listing.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"mt-auto flex justify-between items-end\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-[400px]\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-[#0F172A] mb-2 uppercase text-[12px] tracking-widest\">Sign-off Requirement:</p>\n          <p class=\"text-[14px]\">Deployment is complete only when <code class=\"font-mono text-[12px]\">/health</code> returns HTTP 200 and the live registration form persists a user record.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"text-right\">\n          <p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-400\">END OF BRIEFING // STATUS_INV_20261016</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    }
  ],
